# Crypto API - Project Rules

## Architecture
- **Modular**: Shared code in `js/shared/`, exchange-specific in `js/nobitex/` and `js/wallex/`
- **Lightweight**: Avoid heavy dependencies; prefer vanilla JS
- **Static**: HTML works when opened directly or served via HTTP (no Node/build required)

## Constraints
- **No CORS proxy**: Never use allorigins, cors-anywhere, or similar. Direct API fetch only.
- **No server required**: Must work as static files (GitHub Pages, file://, etc.)

## Shared Modules
- `utils.js` - Formatting, parseBaseMultiplier, hasPriceData, computeSetup
- `tv-api.js` - Binance/third-party price fetch
- `network-db.js` - Withdraw network data and display

## Data
- `data/nobitex-withdraw-networks.json` - Run `scripts/build-withdraw-db.ps1` to update (includes networks + withdrawal fees from Nobitex API)
- Network DB is also embedded in `network-db.js` as fallback
